# High-Stakes Client Review Meeting Schedule and Agenda

**Date:** Tuesday, March 31, 2026  
**Author:** Camila Ramos  
**Location:** HugeSmoothTech Headquarters, Main Conference Room (or Virtual Meeting Link TBD)  

---

## Purpose of the Meeting
The primary objective of this meeting is to evaluate the performance, reliability, and business impact of AI-developed features integrated into the client's project. Feedback from this review will shape future development priorities and client relations strategies. Given the recent debates and concerns surrounding AI adoption, this meeting is considered high-stakes for both HugeSmoothTech and the client.

---

